  <prompt>
    Build the configuration-driven RecordHeader PCF at src/client/pcf/RecordHeader/ (namespace
    Spaarke.Records, constructor RecordHeader) in a NEW solution with UniqueName RecordHeaderPcf,
    generalized from MatterHeader. The manifest keeps boundField/title/showVersion and ADDS
    layoutJson (usage input, of-type per the task-001 spike outcome). Entity + record are
    self-detected from context; the generic view consumes the 031 resolver, the Phase 1 renderers,
    and the Phase 2 hoisted machinery.
  </prompt>

  <role>
    SPAARKE platform developer. Expert in virtual PCF controls on platform libraries (React
    16.14 + Fluent 9), webpack bundle optimization, and PAC solution packaging. Follow ADRs
    strictly.
  </role>

  <goal>
    A buildable, deployable RecordHeader PCF: npm run build:prod green with bundle at or under
    250 KB; RecordHeaderPcf solution ZIP packs and imports into spaarkedev1; the control renders
    from layoutJson config OR derived defaults on any entity form with the full toolbar and
    version footer v1.1.0; unit tests and ui-tests pass.
  </goal>

