  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">NO apostrophes in ANY manifest string attribute value (display-name-key, description-key, and every other attribute) in ControlManifest.Input.xml AND Solution/Controls/sprk_Spaarke.Records.RecordHeader/ControlManifest.xml — pac solution import fails with noAposStringType (pcf-deploy SKILL.md:447; cost R1 a release). Apostrophes in XML comments are fine.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">package.json MUST define BOTH prebuild AND prebuild:prod as node ../../shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/scripts/ensure-dist-fresh.js (copy MatterHeader/package.json lines 6 and 8 verbatim) — binding since 2026-07-07 (NFR-11). build:prod MUST invoke pcf-scripts build --buildMode production.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Every @spaarke/ui-components import in this PCF uses deep dist/* paths (e.g. @spaarke/ui-components/dist/components/RecordHeader, /dist/hooks, /dist/utils/xrmContext). The shared lib has NO exports field; the top-level barrel drags mammoth (~1.6 MB vs ~40 KB). Do NOT "clean up" to barrel imports anywhere in this control (NFR-08; DEF-06 is out of scope).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Delete the stale comment at MatterHeaderView.tsx lines 53-62 claiming the shared lib has an exports map — it does not (the comment survived the task-063 revert) — and do NOT carry any version of that comment into RecordHeaderView.tsx. This is the ONLY MatterHeader change in this task; MatterHeaderPcf stays live until task 081.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">RecordHeaderHost.tsx MUST wrap the view in its own FluentProvider — Fluent v9 portals (Popover/Menu/Dialog) mount outside the PCF subtree and platform-library theming does NOT reach them (pcf-build-scaffold gotcha 6). Mirror MatterHeaderHost.tsx including its dark-mode/theme handling; do not rely on platform auto-theming for portals.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-020">Version sync is FIVE locations, not four: control/ControlManifest.Input.xml, control/version.ts, Solution/solution.xml, Solution/Controls/sprk_Spaarke.Records.RecordHeader/ControlManifest.xml, Solution/pack.ps1. Start at 1.1.0 (spec assumption — new identity carrying R1's feature set; confirm and record in notes). The footer renders the version.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Build deployable bundles with npm run build:prod ONLY — npm run build is dev mode, no tree-shaking, 5-10x bundle bloat (FAILURE-MODES AP-1). Bundle at or under 250 KB minified (NFR-02; R1 baseline 62.4 KiB) — measure and record the byte size in task notes.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Manifest for THIS control: control-type virtual; namespace Spaarke.Records, constructor RecordHeader; platform-library React 16.14.0 + Fluent 9.46.2; feature-usage WebAPI + Utility + Navigation; boundField (SingleLine.Text, usage bound, required true), title (SingleLine.Text, input), showVersion (TwoOptions, input, default true) as in MatterHeader; PLUS layoutJson (usage input, required false, of-type EXACTLY per the recorded task-001 spike outcome).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">FR-12 self-detection in control/index.ts: entity from context.mode.contextInfo.entityTypeName and record from .entityId, falling back to context.page.entityTypeName / context.page.entityId. Both surfaces are absent from @types/powerapps-component-framework — use the established type-cast idiom (VisualHostRoot.tsx:246-253 primary; TrackingFieldTrio/index.ts:337-348 fallback). NO entity logical name may be compiled into the control source.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">RecordHeaderView.tsx contains NO save/search machinery: field writes, pending-buffer display resolution, and lookup projection come ONLY from the hoisted useRecordHeaderFields hook (022); editable lookups ONLY via the 023 OOB-picker cell; toolbar ONLY via useRecordHeaderToolbarActions (024); config ONLY via resolveHeaderConfig (031); shell via RecordHeaderShell with the resolved columns value (032); renderers via the fields barrel (015). MUST NOT fork or re-implement any shared primitive in the PCF layer.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scaffold hygiene from pcf-build-scaffold.md: copy tsconfig.json from MatterHeader (do not hand-author — gotcha 4); add ajv ^8.12.0 devDependency (gotcha 5); NO direct @fluentui/react-icons imports in the PCF layer (gotcha 1); keep the manifest/code layout MatterHeader uses (manifest + index.ts in control/, code path attribute index.ts — gotcha 2); featureconfig.json with pcfReactPlatformLibraries on + pcfAllowCustomWebpack on and webpack.config.js with the react-icons sideEffects false rule (bundle triad).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">New solution: UniqueName RecordHeaderPcf; solution.xml RootComponent type 66 schemaName sprk_Spaarke.Records.RecordHeader; PCF-only solution (no web resources); pack.ps1 adapted from MatterHeader/Solution/pack.ps1 with lowercase ZIP entry names. Do NOT reuse or modify the MatterHeaderPcf solution.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Fluent v9 semantic tokens exclusively in any styling this task authors (version footer, root container) — zero hex/rgb/hsl; dark + high-contrast must resolve (NFR-03).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">React 16/17-safe throughout: no use(), no useSyncExternalStore, no createRoot (NFR-04).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">NFR-05/NFR-06/NFR-09 scope: all Dataverse I/O via Xrm.WebApi / Xrm.Page (through the shared hooks/services); no @spaarke/auth, no raw fetch to the Dataverse API, nothing added to src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api, and no literal record GUIDs / environment names in any shipped artifact.</constraint>
  </constraints>

